# oracle: pair_style mgpt (Ta6.8x MGPT potential, units electron) on a 4x4x4 bcc Ta crystal at the potential's atomic volume (examples/PACKAGES/mgpt/in.bcc0 cut down: 128 atoms), velocities from 3000 K, 4 NVE steps of 1 fs with thermo every step
# native: b332f28 built with -D PKG_MGPT=on -D PKG_MANYBODY=on -D PKG_MOLECULE=on (serial, 1 process, default CMake Release flags, so the MGPT generic linear algebra; the installed lmp lacks MGPT)
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 4.4e-15, atoms 0 (bit for bit).
# oracle-potentials: Ta6.8x.mgpt.parmin Ta6.8x.mgpt.potin
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
units           electron
atom_style      atomic
variable        atomic_vol equal 121.6
variable        lattice_constant equal (${atomic_vol}*2.0)^(1.0/3.0)
lattice         bcc ${lattice_constant}
region          box block 0 4 0 4 0 4
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
pair_style      mgpt
pair_coeff      * * Ta6.8x.mgpt.parmin Ta6.8x.mgpt.potin ${atomic_vol}
velocity        all create 3000.0 87287 loop geom
neighbor        0.1 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check yes
fix             1 all nve
timestep        1.0
thermo          1
thermo_style    custom step temp pe etotal press pxx pyy pzz pxy
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
run             4
